@startuml Sequence Diagram - Laporan
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Generate Laporan\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor User
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(laporan.py)" as flask
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db
participant "Report\nGenerator" as report
participant "Report\nRenderer" as renderer

== Generate Laporan ==

User -> Browser : 1: Buka halaman laporan
Browser -> flask : 2: GET /laporan/
flask -> db : 3: Query statistik (COUNT, SUM)
db --> flask : 4: return data statistik
flask --> Browser : 5: Tampilkan form filter
Browser --> User : 6: Tampilkan halaman

User -> Browser : 7: Pilih periode laporan
Browser -> flask : 8: POST /laporan/generate
flask -> db : 9: SELECT * WHERE tanggal BETWEEN ?
db --> flask : 10: return filtered_data
note left of flask : Note: Laporan berisi data\npasien, prediksi, dan evaluasi
note left of flask : Note: Laporan ditampilkan\ndi halaman web
note left of flask : Note: Filter berdasarkan\nperiode waktu (bulan/tahun)
flask -> report : 11: generate_report(data, format)
report -> renderer : 12: render_report(data, format)
renderer --> report : 13: return file_path
report --> flask : 14: return report_file
flask --> Browser : 15: send_file(report)
Browser --> User : 16: Download/Tampilkan file

@enduml
